@startuml Spring Bean Creation Main Flow

title Spring Bean 创建主要流程

participant "容器启动" as Container
participant "Bean获取" as BeanGet
participant "Bean创建" as BeanCreate
participant "实例化" as Instantiate
participant "属性注入" as Property
participant "初始化" as Initialize
participant "缓存系统" as Cache

== 1. 容器预实例化 ==
Container -> Container: 遍历所有bean定义
note right: 获取beanDefinitionNames副本

loop 每个非抽象单例bean
    Container -> BeanGet: 触发bean获取
end

Container -> Container: 等待后台初始化完成
Container -> Container: 执行SmartInitializingSingleton回调

== 2. Bean获取流程 ==
BeanGet -> BeanGet: 转换bean名称
note right: 处理别名和&前缀

BeanGet -> Cache: 检查singletonObjects
note right: 一级缓存：完全初始化的单例

alt 一级缓存命中
    BeanGet -> BeanGet: 处理FactoryBean
    BeanGet --> Container: 返回bean
else 一级缓存未命中
    BeanGet -> Cache: 检查earlySingletonObjects
    note right: 二级缓存：早期暴露的单例

    alt 二级缓存命中
        BeanGet --> Container: 返回早期引用
    else 需要创建新bean
        BeanGet -> BeanGet: 处理depends-on依赖
        BeanGet -> BeanCreate: 创建bean实例
    end
end

== 3. Bean创建流程 ==
BeanCreate -> Cache: beforeSingletonCreation()
note right: 添加到singletonsCurrentlyInCreation

BeanCreate -> BeanCreate: 检查InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor
note right: 可能直接返回代理对象

alt 返回代理对象
    BeanCreate -> Cache: afterSingletonCreation()
    BeanCreate --> BeanGet: 返回代理
else 执行完整创建
    BeanCreate -> Instantiate: 实例化bean
end

== 4. 实例化阶段 ==
Instantiate -> Instantiate: 选择实例化策略
alt 构造函数自动装配
    Instantiate -> Instantiate: 解析构造函数参数
    Instantiate -> Instantiate: 通过构造函数创建
else 默认构造函数
    Instantiate -> Instantiate: 通过无参构造函数创建
end

Instantiate -> Instantiate: 应用MergedBeanDefinitionPostProcessor
note right: 收集@Autowired注解信息

== 5. 循环依赖处理 ==
alt 需要提前暴露单例
    Instantiate -> Cache: addSingletonFactory()
    note right: 添加到singletonFactories（三级缓存）
    note right: 存储ObjectFactory用于获取早期引用
end

== 6. 属性注入阶段 ==
Instantiate -> Property: 填充bean属性

Property -> Property: 应用InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor
note right: postProcessAfterInstantiation()

alt 配置了自动装配模式
    Property -> Property: 按名称或类型自动装配
    note right: 查找匹配的bean并注入
end

Property -> Property: 应用InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor
note right: postProcessProperties() - 处理@Autowired

Property -> Property: 应用配置的属性值

== 7. 初始化阶段 ==
Property -> Initialize: 初始化bean

Initialize -> Initialize: 调用Aware接口方法
note right: BeanNameAware、BeanFactoryAware等

Initialize -> Initialize: 应用BeanPostProcessor
note right: postProcessBeforeInitialization()

Initialize -> Initialize: 调用初始化方法
note right: @PostConstruct、InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()

Initialize -> Initialize: 应用BeanPostProcessor
note right: postProcessAfterInitialization() - 可能创建AOP代理

== 8. 完成创建 ==
Initialize -> Cache: 检查早期引用一致性
alt 早期引用与当前对象不同
    Initialize -> Initialize: 使用早期引用
end

Initialize -> Cache: addSingleton()
note right: 添加到singletonObjects（一级缓存）
note right: 从singletonFactories和earlySingletonObjects移除

Initialize -> Cache: afterSingletonCreation()
note right: 从singletonsCurrentlyInCreation移除

Initialize -> Initialize: 注册销毁回调

Initialize --> Container: 返回完全初始化的bean

== 缓存系统说明 ==
note over Cache
**三级缓存系统：**
• singletonObjects：一级缓存，存储完全初始化的单例
• earlySingletonObjects：二级缓存，存储早期暴露的单例
• singletonFactories：三级缓存，存储ObjectFactory
• singletonsCurrentlyInCreation：正在创建的单例集合
end note

@enduml